Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeadOnVehicleApproach" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle driving in the opposing lane towards the ego vehicle" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High-speed head-on collision risk due to vehicle intruding into ego path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Head-on collision risk; another vehicle is moving directly towards the ego vehicle in its lane during low-visibility night conditions.
Severity Score: 0.95